# Neutrality allow-list — curated by `.github/neutrality-check.sh`.
#
# Every entry here is a REVIEWED, legitimate occurrence of `material`/`m3e`/`md3`
# in a package that must otherwise stay design-system neutral. A hit NOT covered
# here fails CI. Two entry kinds:
#
#   file:<path>          allow every hit in that file (exact path)
#   file:<dir>/          allow every hit anywhere under that directory
#   <path>::<content>    allow one specific line (path + trimmed line content;
#                        line number is deliberately NOT part of the key, so
#                        reformatting a file doesn't break the gate)
#
# Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored.

